  "title": "White Chocolate-Orange-Pistachio Thumbprint Cookies",
  "description": "Nutty pistachio thumbprint cookies filled with a creamy, citrusy white chocolate are an impressive and tasty little treat for Christmas or other special occasions!",
  "authors": [
    "SunnyDaysNora"
  ],
